/-!
# Tests for comparisons in one spelling

The four pairs of canonical trees the generic source check reported as differing for T5's
wrong-stage negatives (`clampwrongspec-r2`, `siblingfns-r2`, `initbroken-r2`, `invbroken-r2`): the
source's tree and solar's, each already `Tree.canon`, copied from the driver's `trees differ` probe.
The old comparison refuses each pair (`*_old`); `Tree.cmpCanon` makes each pair equal (`*_new`),
so `Tree.agree` accepts the original trees. Control: solar's `lo` tree with its bound 6 changed to 7
(it differs from the source at 6) stays refused (`siblingWrong_new`).
-/

